    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῠναικ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woman-like, womanish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀγεννὲς καὶ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.56.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.366
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνανδρα καὶ γ. πάθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶδες φθέγγεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nigr.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				575
			</span></i>.</div>
